msgid "GPRINT Type"
msgstr "GPRINT-tipe"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "If this graph item is a GPRINT, you can optionally choose another format here. You can define additional types under \"GPRINT Presets\"."
msgstr "As hierdie grafiekitem 'n GPRINT is, kan jy opsioneel hier 'n ander formaat kies. Jy kan bykomende tipes onder \"GPRINT-voorinstellings\" definieer."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Alignment (TEXTALIGN)"
msgstr "Teksbelyning (TEXTALIGN)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "All subsequent legend line(s) will be aligned as given here.  You may use this command multiple times in a single graph.  This command does not produce tabular layout.<br/><strong>Note: </strong>You may want to insert a &lt;HR&gt; on the preceding graph item.<br/> <strong>Note: </strong>A &lt;HR&gt; on this legend line will obsolete this setting!"
msgstr "Alle daaropvolgende legendelyn(e) sal belyn word soos hier gegee.  Jy kan hierdie opdrag verskeie kere in 'n enkele grafiek gebruik.  Hierdie opdrag produseer nie 'n tabulêre uitleg nie.<br/><strong>Let wel: </strong>Jy wil dalk 'n &lt;HR&gt; op die voorafgaande grafiekitem invoeg.<br/> <strong>Let wel: </strong>'n &lt;HR&gt; op hierdie legendelyn sal hierdie instelling verouderd maak!"

