msgstr "Verstek SNMP-herpogings vir alle nuwe toestelle."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Availability/Reachability"
msgstr "Beskikbaarheid/Bereikbaarheid"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Availability/Reachability for all new Devices.  The method Cacti will use to determine if a Device is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Verstek Beskikbaarheid/Bereikbaarheid vir alle nuwe Toestelle.  Die metode wat Cacti sal gebruik om te bepaal of 'n Toestel beskikbaar is vir peiling.  <br><i>LET WEL: Dit word aanbeveel dat SNMP ten minste altyd gekies word.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Type"
msgstr "Ping-tipe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping type for all new Devices.</i>"
msgstr "Verstek Ping-tipe vir alle nuwe Toestelle.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Port for all new Devices.  With TCP, Cacti will attempt to Syn the port.  With UDP, Cacti requires either a successful connection, or a 'port not reachable' error to determine if the Device is up or not."
msgstr "Verstek Ping-poort vir alle nuwe Toestelle.  Met TCP sal Cacti probeer om 'n Syn op die poort uit te voer.  Met UDP vereis Cacti óf 'n suksesvolle verbinding óf 'n 'poort nie bereikbaar nie'-fout om te bepaal of die Toestel op is al dan nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Timeout value in milli-seconds for all new Devices.  The timeout values to use for Device SNMP, ICMP, UDP and TCP pinging.  ICMP Pings will be rounded up to the nearest second.  TCP and UDP connection timeouts on Windows are controlled by the operating system, and are therefore not recommended on Windows."
msgstr "Verstek Ping-uitteltydwaarde in millisekondes vir alle nuwe Toestelle.  Die uitteltydwaardes wat gebruik word vir Toestel-SNMP-, ICMP-, UDP- en TCP-pinging.  ICMP-pings sal opgerond word na die naaste sekonde.  TCP- en UDP-verbindinguitteltye op Windows word deur die bedryfstelsel beheer en word dus nie op Windows aanbeveel nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of times Cacti will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Die aantal kere wat Cacti sal probeer om 'n Toestel te ping voordat dit as af gemerk word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Up/Down Settings"
msgstr "Op/Af-instellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Failure Count"
msgstr "Mislukkingstelling"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must be down before logging an error and reporting Device as down."
msgstr "Die aantal peilingsintervalle wat 'n Toestel af moet wees voordat 'n fout aangeteken en die Toestel as af gerapporteer word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Recovery Count"
msgstr "Hersteltelling"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of polling intervals a Device must remain up before returning Device to an up status and issuing a notice."
msgstr "Die aantal peilingsintervalle wat 'n Toestel op moet bly voordat die Toestel na 'n op-status teruggekeer en 'n kennisgewing uitgereik word."

#: include/global_settings.php
