msgstr "Rye per Bladsy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of rows to display on for a table."
msgstr "Die verstek aantal rye om vir 'n tabel te vertoon."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Autocomplete Enabled"
msgstr "Outovoltooiing geaktiveer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In very large systems, select lists can slow the user interface significantly.  If this option is enabled, Cacti will use autocomplete callbacks to populate the select list systematically.  Note: autocomplete is forcibly disabled on the Classic theme."
msgstr "In baie groot stelsels kan keuselyste die gebruikerskoppelvlak aansienlik vertraag. As hierdie opsie geaktiveer is, sal Cacti outovoltooiing-terugroepe gebruik om die keuselys stelselmatig te vul. Let wel: outovoltooiing word geforseerd gedeaktiveer op die Classic-tema."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Select Search Minimum Rows"
msgstr "Minimum Rye vir Keuselys-soektog"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The minimum number of options a dropdown must have before Cacti shows a search box inside it.  Choose 'Always' to show the search box regardless of the number of options."
msgstr "Die minimum aantal opsies wat 'n aftreklys moet hê voordat Cacti 'n soekkassie daarin wys.  Kies 'Altyd' om die soekkassie te wys ongeag die aantal opsies."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Always"
msgstr "Altyd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Autocomplete Rows"
msgstr "Outovoltooiing-rye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ".  This is limited by the php setting 'max_input_vars', currently:"
msgstr ".  Dit word beperk deur die PHP-instelling 'max_input_vars', tans:"

#: include/global_settings.php
