msgstr "Na hierdie aantal dae sal die besigheidsure nie by die grafiek gevoeg word nie. <br/>Aanbeveel: 62 dae"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Enabled"
msgstr "Data-insameling geaktiveer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to stop the polling process completely, uncheck this box."
msgstr "As jy die peilingsproses heeltemal wil stop, ontmerk hierdie blokkie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Type"
msgstr "Peilertipe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The poller type to use.  This setting will take affect at next polling interval."
msgstr "Die peilertipe om te gebruik. Hierdie instelling sal by die volgende peilingsinterval in werking tree."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Peiler-sinkroniseringsinterval"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Die verstek peiling-sinkroniseringsinterval om te gebruik wanneer 'n peiler geskep word. Hierdie instelling sal beïnvloed hoe gereeld afgeleë peilers nagegaan en opgedateer word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Die peilingsinterval wat gebruik word. Hierdie instelling sal beïnvloed hoe gereeld RRD-lêers nagegaan en opgedateer word. <strong><u>LET WEL: As jy hierdie waarde verander, moet jy die peilerkas hervul. Versuim om dit te doen, kan tot verlore data lei.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Cron/Daemon-interval"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Die frekwensie waarmee die Cacti-data-insamelaar begin sal word. Jy kan óf crontab, 'n geskeduleerde taak (vir Windows), óf die cactid systemd-diens gebruik om die bekendstelling van die Cacti-data-insamelaar te beheer. Vir instruksies oor die gebruik van die cactid-daemon, hersien die README.md-lêer in die diensgids."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Balanseer proseslading"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "As jy hierdie opsie kies, sal Cacti probeer om die lading van elke peilerproses te balanseer deur peileritems gelykop per proses te versprei."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Ontfoutingsafvoerwydte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "As jy hierdie opsie kies, sal Cacti kyk vir afvoer wat Cacti se vermoë om dit te stoor oorskry en 'n waarskuwing uitreik wanneer dit gevind word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Afgeleë agent-tyduitloop"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Die tydsduur, in sekondes, wat die sentrale Cacti-webbediener sal wag vir 'n reaksie van die afgeleë dataversamelaar om verskeie toestelinligting te verkry voordat die versoek laat vaar word.  Op toestelle wat geassosieer word met ander dataversamelaars as die sentrale Cacti-dataversamelaar, moet die afgeleë agent gebruik word om toestelinligting in te samel."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Verfris peilertabel per siklus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Hierdie instelling is slegs vir enkelpeilerstelsels om die peiler-afvoertabel tydens elke peilingsiklus te herbou om te verhoed dat die geheuetabel omruil (swap) op baie groot stelsels met groot databasisse wat swap kan gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Deaktiveer hulpbronkas-replikasie"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "By verstek sal die hoof-Cacti-dataversamelaar die hele webwerf en inproppe in 'n hulpbronkas berg. Daarna sal die afgeleë dataversamelaars hulself periodiek opdateer met enige opdaterings vanaf die hoof-Cacti-dataversamelaar. Hierdie hulpbronkas laat afgeleë dataversamelaars in wese toe om hulself op te gradeer. As jy nie hierdie opsie wil gebruik nie, kan jy dit met hierdie instelling deaktiveer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "SNMP-gedrag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "SNMP-agentondersteuning geaktiveer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "As hierdie opsie gemerk is, sal Cacti SNMP-agenttabelle met Cacti-toestel- en stelselinligting vul. Dit aktiveer nie die SNMP-agent self nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Aktiveer MD5 en DES vir SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Die MD5-verifikasie- en DES-privaatheidsalgoritmes is verouderd, swak en onbeskikbaar op verharde (FIPS) PHP- en Net-SNMP-bouweergawes. Wanneer gedeaktiveer, word MD5 en DES verwyder uit die SNMPv3-verifikasie- en privaatheidsprotokol-aftreklyste wat gewys word wanneer 'n toestel gewysig word en in die Outomatisering-SNMP-opsies, wat slegs die sterker SHA- en AES-algoritmes oorlaat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Aktiveer geloofsbriefkas"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Verhard vooraf en kas SNMPv3-geloofsbriefargumente een keer per geloofsbriefwysiging sodat elke peilerproses dit hergebruik in plaas daarvan om dit by elke versoek te herbou. Dit lewer 'n marginale besparing wanneer met SNMPv3-geloofsbriewe deur die Net-SNMP-binêre lêers versamel word. Die php-snmp-uitbreiding hanteer die meeste SNMPv3-get-versoeke binne-proses en omseil hierdie kas, maar die Net-SNMP-binêre lêers (en dus hierdie kas) word steeds gebruik vir SNMP-walks, heks-afvoer, versoeke wat 'n konteks of enjin-ID stel, en protokolkombinasies wat die lopende PHP-weergawe nie ondersteun nie. Aktiveer dit as jy enige van daardie werkladings met SNMPv3-geloofsbriewe versamel."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "SNMP Get OID-limiet"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Die verstek maksimum aantal SNMP Get-OID's om per snmpget-versoek uit te reik. Vir toestelle word hierdie instelling op toestelvlak beheer. Jy behoort hierdie instelling slegs te gebruik wanneer jy Cacti se SNMP-API direk in jou skripte of inproppe gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "SNMP Bulkwalk-ophalingsgrootte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Hoeveel OID's moet per snmpbulkwalk-versoek teruggestuur word?  Vir Toestelle met groot SNMP-bome sal die verhoging van hierdie grootte die herindekseringswerkverrigting oor 'n WAN verbeter."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Deaktiveer kontrole vir toenemende OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Beheer die deaktivering van die kontrole vir toenemende OID tydens die deurloop van die OID-boom."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Bykomende dataversamelaar-instellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Boekstawing van ongeldige data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Hoe wil jy hê dat die dataversamelaar se afvoerfoute aangeteken word? Opsies sluit in: 'Gedetailleerd' wat elke fout uiteensit, 'Opsomming' wat die aantal afvoerfoute per toestel verskaf, en 'Geen', wat geen fouttellings verskaf nie."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Opsomming"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Gedetailleerd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Aantal PHP-skripbedieners"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige skripbedienerprosesse om per spine-proses te laat loop. Instellings tussen 1 en 15 word aanvaar. Hierdie parameter sal help as jy verskeie drade en skripbedienerskripte laat loop, en is slegs geldig vir die spine-dataversamelaar."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Tydlimietwaarde vir skrip en skripbediener"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Spine sal wag vir 'n skrip om te voltooi. Hierdie tydverstrekingswaarde is in sekondes en is slegs geldig vir die Spine-dataversamelaar."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Periodieke herindeksering van alle toestelle"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Skedule vir herindeksering van alle toestelle"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Teen watter frekwensie wil jy alle toestelle herindekseer? Hierdie herindeksering sal om middernag plaasvind teen die frekwensie wat jy kies."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Weekliks op Sondag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunady"
msgstr "Maandeliks op Sondag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Agtergrond-tydverstreking en gelyktydige prosesinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Tydverstreking vir verslaggenerering"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Cacti se verslaggenerering-skrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydverstrekingsfout te veroorsaak en beëindig te word."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s minuut"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Tydlimiet vir databronstatistieke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Cacti se databronstatistieke-skrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Tydlimiet vir RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Cacti se RRDfile-kontroleskrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydverstrekingsfout te veroorsaak en beëindig te word."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s uur"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Tydlimiet vir peileropdragte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Cacti se agtergrondopdragte-skrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word. Hierdie skrip sal take uitvoer soos die herindeksering van toestelle en die snoei van toestelle vanaf afgeleë dataversamelaars."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Gelyktydige prosesse vir peileropdragte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige peileropdrag-prosesse. Daar sal hoogstens een gelyktydige opdrag per gasheer binne die peileropdragpoel wees."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 proses"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d prosesse"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Tydlimiet vir agtergrondgenerering van instandhouding"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Cacti se instandhoudingskrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Tydlimiet vir agtergrondgenerering van Spikekill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Die maksimum tyd wat Cacti se Spikekill-skrip kan loop sonder om 'n tydlimietfout te genereer en gestop te word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Dataversamelaar-verstekwaardes"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Hierdie instellings word op die dataversamelaarvlak onderhou. Die waardes hier is slegs verstekwaardes wat gebruik word wanneer 'n dataversamelaar die eerste keer geskep word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Dataversamelaar-prosesse"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Die verstekaantal gelyktydige prosesse wat per dataversamelaar uitgevoer word. LET WEL: Vanaf Cacti 1.2 word hierdie instelling in die dataversamelaar onderhou. Voortaan is hierdie waarde slegs 'n voorafinstelling vir die dataversamelaar. Die gebruik van 'n hoër getal wanneer cmd.php gebruik word, sal werkverrigting verbeter. Werkverrigtingverbeterings in Spine word die beste met die drade-parameter bereik. Wanneer Spine gebruik word, beveel ons 'n laer getal aan en om eerder drade te benut. Wanneer cmd.php gebruik word, gebruik hoogstens 2x die aantal CPU-kerne."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Drade per proses"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Cacti 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Die verstekaantal drade wat per proses toegelaat word. LET WEL: Vanaf Cacti 1.2+ word hierdie instelling in die dataversamelaar onderhou, en hierdie is bloot die voorafinstelling. Die gebruik van 'n hoër getal wanneer Spine gebruik word, sal werkverrigting verbeter. Maak egter seker dat u genoeg MySQL/MariaDB-verbindings het om die volgende vergelyking te ondersteun: verbindings = dataversamelaars * prosesse * (drade + skripbedieners). U moet ook verseker dat u genoeg reserweverbindings het vir gebruikeraanmeldingsverbindings."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Stawingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Ingeboude stawing</i> - Cacti hanteer gebruikerstawing, wat jou toelaat om gebruikers te skep en aan hulle regte tot verskillende areas binne Cacti te gee.<br><br><i>Basiese webstawing</i> - Stawing word deur die webbediener hanteer. Gebruikers kan outomaties bygevoeg of geskep word by die eerste aanmelding indien die sjabloongebruiker gedefinieer is, andersins sal die gedefinieerde gastetoestemmings gebruik word.<br><br><i>LDAP-stawing</i> - Laat stawing teen 'n LDAP-bediener toe. Gebruikers sal outomaties geskep word by die eerste aanmelding indien die sjabloongebruiker gedefinieer is, andersins sal die gedefinieerde gastetoestemmings gebruik word. Indien PHP se LDAP-module nie geaktiveer is nie, sal LDAP-stawing nie as 'n kiesbare opsie verskyn nie.<br><br><i>Meervoudige LDAP/AD-domeinstawing</i> - Laat administrateurs toe om verskeie afsonderlike groepe van verskillende LDAP/AD-gidse te ondersteun om toegang tot Cacti-hulpbronne te verkry. Net soos LDAP-stawing, word die PHP LDAP-module vereis om hierdie metode te gebruik.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Ondersteun stawingkoekies"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "As 'n gebruiker staaf en 'Hou my aangemeld' kies, sal 'n stawingskoekie op die gebruiker se rekenaar geskep word wat daardie gebruiker toelaat om aangemeld te bly. Die stawingskoekie verval ná 90 dae van nie-gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Spesiale gebruikers"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Primêre administrateur"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Cacti system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Die naam van die primêre administratiewe rekening wat outomaties e-posse sal ontvang wanneer die Cacti-stelsel probleme ondervind. Om hierdie e-posse te ontvang, maak seker dat jou e-posinstellings korrek is en dat die administratiewe rekening 'n e-posadres het wat gestel is."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Geen gebruiker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Gasgebruiker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Die naam van die gasgebruiker vir die besigtiging van grafieke; is by verstek 'Geen gebruiker'."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Gebruikersjabloon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Cacti will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Die naam van die gebruiker wat Cacti as 'n sjabloon sal gebruik vir nuwe basiese web- en LDAP-gebruikers; is by verstek 'guest'. Hierdie gebruikersrekening sal gedeaktiveer word om aan te meld sodra dit gekies word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Basiese stawinginstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Mislukte aanmeldingsboodskap vir basiese stawing"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Cacti account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Wanneer basiese stawing gebruik word en daar probleme is om die gebruikersnaam na 'n geldige Cacti-rekening te karteer, sal die boodskap wat hier ingesluit is aan gebruikers vertoon word. Dit kan beide teks en HTML insluit."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Karteringslêer vir basiese stawing"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Wanneer basiese stawing gebruik word en die basiese rekening na 'n ander aanmeldingsrekening omgeskakel moet word, kan jy hier 'n CSV-lêer spesifiseer om die basiese rekening na die verlangde aanmeldingsrekening te karteer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Kompleksiteitsvereistes vir plaaslike rekeninge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Minimum lengte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Dit is die minimum lengte van toegelate wagwoorde."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Vereis gemengde letterkas"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contains both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Dit sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde beide klein- en hoofletters bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Vereis syfer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Dit sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde ten minste 1 numeriese karakter bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Vereis spesiale karakter"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Dit sal vereis dat nuwe wagwoorde ten minste 1 spesiale karakter bevat."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Dwing kompleksiteit op ou wagwoorde af"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Dit sal vereis dat alle ou wagwoorde ook by aanmelding aan die nuwe kompleksiteitsvereistes voldoen. Indien nie, sal dit 'n wagwoordverandering afdwing."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Verval onaktiewe rekeninge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Dit is die maksimum aantal dae voordat onaktiewe rekeninge gedeaktiveer word. Die Admin-rekening is van hierdie beleid uitgesluit."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Verval wagwoord"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Dit is die maksimum aantal dae voordat 'n wagwoord gestel word om te verval."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Password History"
msgstr "Wagwoordgeskiedenis"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remember this number of old passwords and disallow reusing them."
msgstr "Onthou hierdie aantal ou wagwoorde en verbied die hergebruik daarvan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Change"
msgstr "1 Verandering"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Changes"
msgstr "%d Veranderinge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Account Locking"
msgstr "Sluiting van rekeninge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock Accounts"
msgstr "Sluit rekeninge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Lock an account after this many failed attempts in 1 hour."
msgstr "Sluit 'n rekening na hierdie aantal mislukte pogings binne 1 uur."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Attempt"
msgstr "1 poging"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Attempts"
msgstr "%d pogings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Outomatiese ontsluiting"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "An account will automatically be unlocked after this many minutes.  Even if the correct password is entered, the account will not unlock until this time limit has been met.  Max of 1440 minutes (1 Day)"
msgstr "'n Rekening sal outomaties na hierdie aantal minute ontsluit word. Selfs al word die korrekte wagwoord ingevoer, sal die rekening nie ontsluit word voordat hierdie tydsbeperking bereik is nie. Maksimum van 1440 minute (1 dag)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Day"
msgstr "1 dag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP General Settings"
msgstr "Algemene LDAP-instellings"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Server(s)"
msgstr "Bediener(s)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Cacti will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user.<br><br>For One-Time Password (OTP/MFA) logins, do not use a space delimited multi-server list.  On a failed bind Cacti advances to the next server and re-binds with the same credentials, and the already-consumed one-time code will be rejected.  Instead enter a single, resilient DNS name fronted by a DNS load balancer (VIP) so that server failover is handled below Cacti and only one authentication bind is ever performed."
msgstr "'n Spasiegeskeide lys van DNS-gasheernames of IP-adresse vir geldige LDAP-bedieners. Cacti sal probeer om die LDAP-bedieners van links na regs te gebruik om 'n gebruiker te staaf.<br><br>Vir aanmeldings met 'n eenmalige wagwoord (OTP/MFA), moenie 'n spasiegeskeide multibedienerlys gebruik nie. By 'n mislukte binding gaan Cacti aan na die volgende bediener en verbind weer met dieselfde geloofsbriewe, en die reeds verbruikte eenmalige kode sal verwerp word. Voer eerder 'n enkele, veerkragtige DNS-naam in wat deur 'n DNS-lasbalanseerder (VIP) voorafgegaan word, sodat bedieneroorskakeling onder Cacti hanteer word en slegs een stawingsbinding ooit uitgevoer word."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port Standard"
msgstr "Standaardpoort"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for Non-SSL communications including LDAP + TLS.  Default is 389."
msgstr "TCP-poort vir nie-SSL-kommunikasie, insluitend LDAP + TLS. Verstekwaarde is 389."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Port SSL"
msgstr "SSL-poort"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for LDAPS for SSL communications.  Default is 636."
msgstr "TCP-poort vir LDAPS vir SSL-kommunikasie. Verstekwaarde is 636."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Protocol Version"
msgstr "Protokolweergawe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Protocol Version to connect to the server with."
msgstr "Protokolweergawe waarmee na die bediener verbind word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Verbindingstydverstreking"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Die netwerkverbindingstydverstreking in sekondes."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bind Timeout"
msgstr "Bindingsuitteltyd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Bind Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Die bindingstydverstreking in sekondes."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP Debug Mode"
msgstr "LDAP-ontfoutingsmodus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Cacti will log extra LDAP information to the Cacti log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Indien gemerk, sal Cacti ekstra LDAP-inligting na die Cacti-logboek aanteken tydens bindings- en soekaktiwiteite."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Enkripsie"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Encryption that the server supports. NOTE: When using LDAP + TLS you must use version 3."
msgstr "Enkripsie wat die bediener ondersteun. LET WEL: Wanneer LDAP + TLS gebruik word, moet u weergawe 3 gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "TLS-sertifikaatvereistes"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should LDAP verify TLS Certificates when received by the Client."
msgstr "Moet LDAP TLS-sertifikate verifieer wanneer dit deur die kliënt ontvang word."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "Verwysings"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "Aktiveer of deaktiveer LDAP-verwysings. As dit gedeaktiveer is, kan dit die spoed van soektogte verhoog."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Modus"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user's password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the user's single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Modus waarmee Cacti sal poog om teen die LDAP-bediener te verifieer.<blockquote><i>Geen soektog</i> - Geen onderskeie naam (DN)-soektog vind plaas nie; poog slegs om met die verskafte onderskeie naam (DN)-formaat te bind.<br><br><i>Anonieme soektog</i> - Poog om na die gebruikersnaam in die LDAP-gids te soek deur anonieme binding om die gebruiker se onderskeie naam (DN) op te spoor.<br><br><i>Spesifieke soektog</i> - Poog om na die gebruikersnaam in die LDAP-gids te soek deur middel van 'n spesifieke onderskeie naam (DN) en spesifieke wagwoord vir binding om die gebruiker se onderskeie naam (DN) op te spoor.<br><br><i>Eenmalige wagwoorde (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti bind die gebruiker se wagwoord slegs een keer, tydens finale verifikasie. <i>Geen soektog</i> doen geen gidsopsoek nie en bind direk met die onderskeie naam (DN)-sjabloon, dus is dit veilig vir OTP wanneer die DN-sjabloon alleen die gebruiker identifiseer. Wanneer 'n gidsopsoek nodig is om die DN op te los, gebruik <i>Spesifieke soektog</i> met 'n toegewyde diensrekening (of <i>Anonieme soektog</i> waar die gids dit toelaat) sodat die opsoek nooit die gebruiker se enkelgebruik-kode verbruik nie. Vir veerkragtige OTP-ontplooiings, gebruik 'n enkele DNS-lasbalanseerdernaam in die Bediener(s)-veld eerder as 'n spasie-geskeide multibedienerlys, wat die binding weer sou probeer met 'n reeds verbruikte eenmalige wagwoord."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Onderskeidende naam (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Die \"Onderskeidende naam\"-sintaksis, van toepassing op beide OpenLDAP- en Windows AD-konfigurasies, bied buigsaamheid om gebruikersidentiteit te definieer. Vir OpenLDAP volg die formaat hierdie struktuur: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD bied 'n alternatiewe sintaksis: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, algemeen bekend as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In hierdie konteks verteenwoordig \"&lt;username&gt;\" die spesifieke gebruikersnaam wat tydens die aanmeldpor verskaf word. Dit is veral relevant wanneer daar in \"Geen soektog\"-modus gewerk word, of met \"Vereis groeplidmaatskap\" geaktiveer."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "Vereis groeplidmaatskap"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause authentication failure."
msgstr "Vereis dat gebruiker lid van 'n groep moet wees om te verifieer. Groepinstellings moet opgestel wees vir hierdie funksie om te werk; aktivering sonder behoorlike groepinstellings sal verifikasiemislukking veroorsaak."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Group Settings"
msgstr "LDAP-groepinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Groep se onderskeidende naam (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "Onderskeie naam van die groep waarvan die gebruiker lid moet wees."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Groeplidattribuut"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Dit verwys na die spesifieke attribuut binne die LDAP-gids wat die gebruikersname van groeplede bevat. Dit is noodsaaklik om te verseker dat die attribuutwaarde ooreenstem met die konfigurasie wat in die \"Onderskeidende naam\" gespesifiseer is, of dat die werklike attribuutwaarde soekbaar is deur die instellings te gebruik wat in die \"Onderskeidende naam\" uiteengesit is."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "Groeplidtipe"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "Definieer of gebruikers die volle onderskeidende naam of slegs die gebruikersnaam in die gedefinieerde groeplidattribuut gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Distinguished Name"
msgstr "Onderskeie naam"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Specific Search Settings"
msgstr "LDAP spesifieke soekinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Soekbasis"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> or <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."
msgstr "Soekbasis om die LDAP-gids te deursoek, soos <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> of <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "Soekfilter"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt. "
msgstr "Soekfilter om te gebruik om die gebruiker in die LDAP-gids op te spoor, soos vir Windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> of vir OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>. '&lt;username&gt' word vervang met die gebruikersnaam wat by die aanmeldaanwysing verskaf is. "

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Soek-onderskeidende naam (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Onderskeidende naam vir spesifieke soekbinding aan die LDAP-gids."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Password"
msgstr "Soekwagwoord"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Password for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "Wagwoord vir spesifieke soekbinding aan die LDAP-gids."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP CN Settings"
msgstr "LDAP CN-instellings"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Full Name when creating a new user, taken from LDAP. (on windows: displayname) "
msgstr "Veld wat die Volle Naam sal vervang wanneer 'n nuwe gebruiker geskep word, geneem uit LDAP. (op Windows: displayname) "

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-pos"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Email taken from LDAP. (on windows: mail)"
msgstr "Veld wat die e-posadres wat uit LDAP geneem is sal vervang. (op Windows: mail)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL Linking"
msgstr "URL-koppeling"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Server Base URL"
msgstr "Bediener-basis-URL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a the server location that will be used for links to the Cacti site. This should include the subdirectory if Cacti does not run from root folder."
msgstr "Dit is die bedienerligging wat vir skakels na die Cacti-werf gebruik sal word. Dit moet die subgids insluit indien Cacti nie vanaf die wortelgids loop nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "E-posopsies"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Notify Primary Admin of Issues"
msgstr "Stel Primêre Administrateur in kennis van probleme"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In cases where the Cacti server is experiencing problems, should the Primary Administrator be notified by Email?  The Primary Administrator's Cacti user account is specified under the Authentication tab on Cacti's settings page. It defaults to the 'admin' account."
msgstr "Moet die Primêre Administrateur per e-pos in kennis gestel word in gevalle waar die Cacti-bediener probleme ondervind? Die Primêre Administrateur se Cacti-gebruikersrekening word onder die Verifikasie-oortjie op Cacti se instellingsbladsy gespesifiseer. Dit is by verstek die 'admin'-rekening."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Test Email"
msgstr "Toets-e-pos"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "Dit is 'n e-posrekening wat gebruik word om 'n toetsboodskap te stuur om te verseker dat alles behoorlik werk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mail Services"
msgstr "Posdienste"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which mail service to use in order to send mail"
msgstr "Watter posdiens om te gebruik om pos te stuur"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Mail Server"
msgstr "Ping posbediener"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping the Mail Server before sending test Email?"
msgstr "Ping die posbediener voordat toets-e-pos gestuur word?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Van-e-posadres"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Dit is die e-posadres wat as die afsender van die e-pos sal verskyn."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Van-naam"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Dit is die werklike naam wat as die afsender van die e-pos sal verskyn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Word Wrap"
msgstr "Woordomvou"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "Dit is hoeveel karakters toegelaat sal word voordat 'n reël in die e-pos outomaties omgevou word. (0 = Gedeaktiveer)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Sendmail Options"
msgstr "Sendmail-opsies"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/functions.php
msgid "Sendmail Path"
msgstr "Sendmail-pad"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "Dit is die pad na sendmail op jou bediener. (Word slegs gebruik as Sendmail as die Posdiens gekies is)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Options"
msgstr "SMTP-opsies"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Hostname"
msgstr "SMTP-gasheernaam"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "Dit is die gasheernaam/IP van die SMTP-bediener waarna jy die e-pos sal stuur. Vir oorskakeling (failover), skei jou gashere met 'n kommapunt."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Port"
msgstr "SMTP-poort"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The port on the SMTP Server to use."
msgstr "Die poort op die SMTP-bediener om te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Username"
msgstr "SMTP-gebruikersnaam"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The username to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Die gebruikersnaam om mee te verifieer wanneer via SMTP gestuur word. (Laat leeg indien jy nie verifikasie benodig nie.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Password"
msgstr "SMTP-wagwoord"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "Die wagwoord om mee te verifieer wanneer via SMTP gestuur word. (Laat leeg indien jy nie verifikasie benodig nie.)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Security"
msgstr "SMTP-sekuriteit"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The encryption method to use for the Email."
msgstr "Die enkripsiemetode om vir die e-pos te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SSL"
msgstr "SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS"
msgstr "TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Timeout"
msgstr "SMTP-uitteltyd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the SMTP timeout in seconds."
msgstr "Voer asseblief die SMTP-uitteltyd in sekondes in."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Reporting Presets"
msgstr "Voorafinstellings vir verslagdoening"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Graph Image Format"
msgstr "Verstek grafiekbeeldformaat"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating a new report, what image type should be used for the inline graphs."
msgstr "Watter beeldtipe moet vir inlyn-grafieke gebruik word wanneer 'n nuwe verslag geskep word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum E-Mail Size"
msgstr "Maksimum e-posgrootte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the E-Mail message including all attachments."
msgstr "Die maksimum grootte van die e-posboodskap insluitend alle aanhangsels."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Logging Level for Cacti Reporting"
msgstr "Aantekenvlak van die peiler vir Cacti-verslagdoening"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file. WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Watter vlak van besonderhede wil u na die loglêer stuur. WAARSKUWING: As dit op enige ander status as NONE of LOW gelaat word, kan dit u skyfspasie vinnig uitput."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Lotus Notes (R) tweak"
msgstr "Aktiveer Lotus Notes (R)-aanpassing"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable code tweak for specific handling of Lotus Notes Mail Clients."
msgstr "Aktiveer kode-aanpassing vir spesifieke hantering van Lotus Notes-e-poskliënte."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Options"
msgstr "DNS-opsies"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Primêre DNS-IP-adres"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the primary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Voer die primêre DNS-IP-adres in om vir omgekeerde opsoekings te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Secondary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "Sekondêre DNS-IP-adres"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the secondary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "Voer die sekondêre DNS-IP-adres in om vir omgekeerde opsoekings te gebruik."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Timeout"
msgstr "DNS-uitteltyd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds.  Cacti uses a PHP based DNS resolver."
msgstr "Voer asseblief die DNS-uitteltyd in millisekondes in. Cacti gebruik 'n PHP-gebaseerde DNS-oplosser."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Instellings vir RRD-opdatering op aanvraag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Aktiveer RRD-opdatering op aanvraag"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Moet Boost RRD-opdatering op aanvraag in Cacti aktiveer? As u dit deaktiveer, sal hierdie verandering eers ná die volgende peilingsiklus in werking tree. Wanneer u afgeleë dataversamelaars het, moet hierdie instelling geaktiveer wees."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Stelselvlak-RRD-opdateerder"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Voordat RRD-opdatering op aanvraag skoongemaak kan word, moet 'n peilerlopie altyd voltooi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Hoe gereeld moet Boost alle RRD's opdateer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Wanneer u Boost aktiveer, word u RRD-lêers slegs opgedateer wanneer dit deur 'n gebruiker versoek word, of wanneer hierdie tydperk verstryk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Aantal Boost-prosesse"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige Boost-prosesse om te gebruik om al die RRD's in die Boost-tabel te verwerk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Maksimum rekords"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "As die Boost-afvoertabel hierdie grootte, in rekords, oorskry, sal 'n opdatering plaasvind."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Target Archive Rows Per Range"
msgstr "Teikenargiefrye per reeks"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Boost updater assigns complete Local Data IDs to contiguous ranges near this row count. A single Local Data ID is never split, so a range can exceed the target. Lower this value to reduce updater memory and query time. The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Die Boost-opdateerder ken volledige Plaaslike Data-ID's toe aan aaneenlopende reekse naby hierdie rytelling. 'n Enkele Plaaslike Data-ID word nooit verdeel nie, so 'n reeks kan die teiken oorskry. Verlaag hierdie waarde om opdateerdergeheue en navraagtyd te verminder. Die verstekwaarde is 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Maksimum argumentlengte"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Wanneer Boost opdateringsopdragte na RRDtool stuur, mag dit nie die bedryfstelsel se maksimum argumentlengte oorskry nie. Dit wissel volgens bedryfstelsel en kernvlak. Byvoorbeeld: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ onbeperk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Geheuelimiet vir Boost en peiler"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Die maksimum hoeveelheid geheue vir die Cacti-peiler en Boost se peiler"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Maksimum looptyd vir RRD-opdateringskrip"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "As die Boost-peiler hierdie looptyd oorskry, sal 'n waarskuwing in die Cacti-logboek geplaas word,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRDs Queued"
msgstr "Maksimum mislukte RRD's in wagry"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of RRD destinations retained for automatic Boost retry. Only the latest complete failed update is retained per destination."
msgstr "Maksimum aantal RRD-bestemmings wat behou word vir outomatiese Boost-herprobering. Slegs die jongste volledige mislukte opdatering word per bestemming behou."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Failed RRD Retry Budget"
msgstr "Begroting vir mislukte RRD-herprobering"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum queued RRD destinations retried by one scheduled Boost run."
msgstr "Maksimum aantal RRD-bestemmings in die wagry wat deur een geskeduleerde Boost-lopie herprobeer word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRD Retries"
msgstr "Maksimum mislukte RRD-herproberings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Queued RRD updates are explicitly discarded after this many failed automatic attempts."
msgstr "RRD-opdaterings in die wagry word uitdruklik weggegooi na soveel mislukte outomatiese pogings."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRD Age"
msgstr "Maksimum ouderdom van mislukte RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Days to retain the latest failed RRD update before explicit discard."
msgstr "Aantal dae om die jongste mislukte RRD-opdatering te behou voordat dit uitdruklik weggegooi word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Boost Debug Log"
msgstr "Boost-ontfoutingslog"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this field is non-blank, Boost will log RRDUpdate output from the boost\tpoller process."
msgstr "As hierdie veld nie leeg is nie, sal Boost die RRDUpdate-afvoer vanaf die boost\tpoller-proses aanteken."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Image Caching"
msgstr "Beeldkasberging"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Image Caching"
msgstr "Aktiveer beeldkasberging"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should image caching be enabled?"
msgstr "Moet beeldkasberging geaktiveer word?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Location for Image Files"
msgstr "Ligging vir beeldlêers"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Specify the location where Boost should place your image files.  These files will be automatically purged by the poller when they expire."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die ligging waar Boost u beeldlêers moet plaas. Hierdie lêers sal outomaties deur die peiler verwyder word wanneer dit verval."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Sources Statistics"
msgstr "Databronne-statistiek"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Data Source Statistics Collection"
msgstr "Aktiveer insameling van databronstatistiek"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Data Source Statistics be collected for this Cacti system?"
msgstr "Moet databronstatistiek vir hierdie Cacti-stelsel ingesamel word?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of DSStats Processes"
msgstr "Aantal DSStats-prosesse"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige DSStats-prosesse om te gebruik om al die databronne te verwerk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Daily Update Frequency"
msgstr "Daaglikse opdateringsfrekwensie"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequent should Daily Stats be updated?"
msgstr "Hoe gereeld moet daaglikse statistiek bygewerk word?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hourly Average Window"
msgstr "Uurlikse gemiddeldevenster"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Die aantal opeenvolgende ure wat die uurlikse gemiddelde verteenwoordig. Hou in gedagte dat 'n té hoë instelling tot baie groot geheuetabelle kan lei"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Time"
msgstr "Onderhoudstyd"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What time of day should Weekly, Monthly, and Yearly Data be updated?  Format is HH:MM [am/pm]"
msgstr "Hoe laat van die dag moet weeklikse, maandelikse en jaarlikse data bygewerk word? Formaat is HH:MM [am/pm]"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Data Source Statistics Data Collector"
msgstr "Geheuelimiet vir databronstatistiek-dataversamelaar"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Data Source Statistics Poller"
msgstr "Die maksimum hoeveelheid geheue vir die Cacti-peiler en databronstatistiek-peiler"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Check"
msgstr "RRDfile-kontrole"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable RRDfile Check"
msgstr "Aktiveer RRDfile-kontrole"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should RRDfile check be enabled for this Cacti system?"
msgstr "Moet RRDfile-kontrole vir hierdie Cacti-stelsel geaktiveer word?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of RRDfile Check Processes"
msgstr "Aantal RRDfile-kontroleprosesse"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent RRDfile check processes to use to use to process all of rrd files."
msgstr "Die aantal gelyktydige RRDfile-kontroleprosesse om te gebruik om al die RRD-lêers te verwerk."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check Frequency"
msgstr "Kontrolefrekwensie"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequent should RRD be checked ?"
msgstr "Hoe gereeld moet RRD gekontroleer word?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Storage Settings"
msgstr "Databergingsinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Choose if RRDs will be stored locally or being handled by an external RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Kies of RRD's plaaslik gestoor sal word of deur 'n eksterne RRDtool-instaanbediener hanteer word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server"
msgstr "RRDtool-instaanbediener"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Structure RRDfile Paths"
msgstr "Struktureer RRDfile-paaie"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "Aktiveer gestruktureerde paaie"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each hosts RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "Gebruik 'n aparte subgids vir elke gasheer se RRD-lêers. Die benaming van die RRD-lêers sal een van die volgende wees:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Jy kan hierdie verandering ná installasie maak deur die CLI-skrip <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> uit te voer nadat jy die verandering gemaak het. LET WEL: As jy die Maksimum gidse-waarde verander om die aantal gidse te verminder, of as jy die Gidspatroon verander, sal leë gidse nie verwyder word nadat jy die <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b>-skrip weer uitgevoer het nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Gidspatroon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths.  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Watter gidspatroon wil jy vir gestruktureerde RRD-paaie gebruik. 'Toestel-ID' is die verstekwaarde. Die instelling 'Toestel-ID/Datanavraag-ID' moet gebruik word wanneer jy toestelle met duisende grafieke het. Nadat jy die gidspatroon verander het, moet jy die CLI-skrip vir gestruktureerde paaie weer uitvoer om die RRDfile-paaie na die nuwe patroon te wysig."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "Toestel-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Toestel-ID/Datanavraag-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID"
msgstr "Toestelhuts/Toestel-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Hash/Device ID/Data Query ID"
msgstr "Toestelhuts/Toestel-ID/Datanavraag-ID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Device Hash Directories"
msgstr "Maksimum toestelhuts-gidse"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum number of Device Directories to be created based upon hashed Device ID's."
msgstr "Die maksimum aantal toestelgidse wat geskep moet word gebaseer op gehutste toestel-ID's."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Instaanbediener"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Die DNS-gasheernaam of IP-adres van die RRDtool-instaanbediener."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Port Number"
msgstr "Instaanbediener-poortnommer"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication."
msgstr "TCP-poort vir geënkripteerde kommunikasie."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "RSA-vingerafdruk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Die vingerafdruk van die huidige publieke RSA-sleutel wat die instaanbediener gebruik. Dit word vereis om 'n vertroude verbinding tot stand te bring."

#: include/global_settings.php
