#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Piekverwyderingsinstellings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Verwyderingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Daar is twee verwyderingsmetodes. Die eerste, Standaardafwyking, sal enige monster verwyder wat X aantal standaardafwykings van die gemiddelde van monsters af is. Die tweede metode, Variansie, sal enige monster verwyder wat X% meer as die Variansie-gemiddelde is. Die Variansie-metode neem 'n sekere aantal 'uitskieters' in ag. Dit is uitsonderlike monsters, soos 'n piek, wat uit die Variansie-gemiddelde-berekening uitgesluit moet word."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Standaardafwyking"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Variansie-gebaseer met uitskieters verwyder"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Vervangingsmetode"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Daar is drie vervangingsmetodes.  Die eerste metode vervang die piek met die gemiddelde van die betrokke databron.  Die tweede metode vervang die piek met 'n 'NaN'.  Die laaste vervang die piek met die laas bekende goeie waarde wat gevind is."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Gemiddelde"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "NaN's"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Laas Bekende Goeie"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Aantal Standaardafwykings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Enige waarde wat soveel standaardafwykings bo die gemiddelde is, sal uitgesluit word.  'n Goeie getal sal afhang van die tipe data waarop gewerk word.  Ons beveel 'n getal van nie laer as 5 Standaardafwykings aan nie."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "%d Standaardafwykings"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Variansiepersentasie"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Hierdie waarde verteenwoordig die persentasie bokant die aangepaste monstergemiddelde nadat uitskieters uit die monster verwyder is. Byvoorbeeld, 'n Variansiepersentasie van 100%% op 'n aangepaste gemiddelde van 50 sal enige monster bokant die hoeveelheid van 100 van die grafiek verwyder."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Variansie-aantal uitskieters"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Hierdie waarde verteenwoordig die aantal hoë en lae gemiddelde monsters wat uit die monsterstel verwyder sal word voordat die variansiegemiddelde bereken word.  As u 'n uitskieterwaarde van 5 kies, word beide die boonste en onderste 5 gemiddeldes verwyder."

