#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "In die geval van probleme word dit sterk aanbeveel dat u u blaaierkas skoonmaak, u blaaier toemaak en weer oopmaak (nie net die oortjie waarop Cacti oop is nie) en weer probeer, voordat u 'n probleem by The Cacti Group aanmeld"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "In seldsame gevalle het ons verslae ontvang van gebruikers wat geringe probleme ervaar weens veranderinge in die kode. Hierdie probleme word veroorsaak deurdat die blaaier kode van voor die opgradering behou, en hoewel ons stappe gedoen het om die kans hierop te verminder, kan dit steeds voorkom. Indien u instruksies benodig oor hoe om u blaaierkas skoon te maak, is <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> 'n goeie beginpunt."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Indien u steeds probleme ervaar nadat u u kas skoongemaak en u blaaier herbegin het, meld asseblief die probleem by ons aan en ons sal probeer om die oorsaak daarvan te identifiseer."

