msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Sodra al die veranderlikes in die config.php-lêer gestel is, moet jy ook die $rdatabase_username toegang tot die hoof-Cacti-databasisbediener gee.  Volg dieselfde prosedure as wat jy met enige ander Cacti-installasie sou volg.  Jy kan dan op die 'Toets verbinding'-knoppie druk.  As die toets slaag, sal jy kan voortgaan en die installasie voltooi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Bykomende stappe ná installasie"

