#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Default collation used by the server when creating databases and tables."
msgstr "Verstek-kollasie wat deur die bediener gebruik word wanneer databasisse en tabelle geskep word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "e.g. utf8mb4_unicode_ci, utf8mb4_general_ci."
msgstr "bv. utf8mb4_unicode_ci, utf8mb4_general_ci."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Default character set used by the server."
msgstr "Verstek-karakterstel wat deur die bediener gebruik word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "e.g. utf8mb4, utf8, latin1."
msgstr "bv. utf8mb4, utf8, latin1."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Character set the client uses when sending statements to the server."
msgstr "Karakterstel wat die kliënt gebruik wanneer stellings na die bediener gestuur word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum number of simultaneous client connections permitted."
msgstr "Maksimum aantal gelyktydige kliëntverbindings toegelaat."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer; default 151. Allow enough for the pollers plus user logins."
msgstr "Heelgetal; verstek 151. Laat genoeg toe vir die peilers plus gebruikersaanmeldings."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Legacy name for the open-table cache; renamed to table_open_cache."
msgstr "Verouderde naam vir die ooptabelkas; hernoem na table_open_cache."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer. Use table_open_cache on modern servers."
msgstr "Heelgetal. Gebruik table_open_cache op moderne bedieners."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum size of one packet or any generated/intermediate string."
msgstr "Maksimum grootte van een pakket of enige gegenereerde/tussentydse string."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; keep at or above 16M for remote pollers."
msgstr "Grepe; hou op of bo 16M vir afgeleë peilers."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum size to which user-created MEMORY tables may grow."
msgstr "Maksimum grootte waartoe gebruikergeskape MEMORY-tabelle mag groei."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; sized relative to total system memory."
msgstr "Grepe; grootte bepaal relatief tot totale stelselgeheue."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum size of internal in-memory temporary tables before they spill to disk."
msgstr "Maksimum grootte van interne tydelike tabelle in geheue voordat hulle na skyf oorloop."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; a larger value keeps temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Grepe; 'n groter waarde hou tydelike tabelle in geheue."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Minimum per-join buffer size for joins that do not use indexes."
msgstr "Minimum buffergrootte per koppeling vir koppelings wat nie indekse gebruik nie."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; per-connection allocation, default 262144."
msgstr "Grepe; toekenning per verbinding, verstek 262144."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Per-session buffer allocated for sorts (ORDER BY / GROUP BY)."
msgstr "Buffer per sessie toegeken vir sorterings (ORDER BY / GROUP BY)."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; per-connection allocation, default 2097152."
msgstr "Grepe; toekenning per verbinding, verstek 2097152."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Store each InnoDB table and its indexes in its own .ibd tablespace file."
msgstr "Stoor elke InnoDB-tabel en sy indekse in sy eie .ibd-tabelspasielêer."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF; ON is recommended."
msgstr "ON of OFF; ON word aanbeveel."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "InnoDB on-disk file format (Antelope or Barracuda); Barracuda is now the only format."
msgstr "InnoDB-lêerformaat op skyf (Antelope of Barracuda); Barracuda is nou die enigste formaat."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Antelope, Barracuda."
msgstr "Antelope, Barracuda."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Allow index key prefixes longer than 767 bytes (requires the Barracuda format)."
msgstr "Laat indekssleutelvoorvoegsels langer as 767 grepe toe (vereis die Barracuda-formaat)."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON/1 or OFF/0; this behaviour is now always enabled."
msgstr "ON/1 of OFF/0; hierdie gedrag is nou altyd geaktiveer."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Total memory InnoDB uses to cache table and index data."
msgstr "Totale geheue wat InnoDB gebruik om tabel- en indeksdata te kas."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; commonly 25%-80% of total system memory."
msgstr "Grepe; gewoonlik 25%-80% van totale stelselgeheue."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Write pages twice (the doublewrite buffer) to protect against partial page writes."
msgstr "Skryf bladsye twee keer (die dubbelskryfbuffer) om teen gedeeltelike bladsyskrywings te beskerm."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF."
msgstr "ON of OFF."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Legacy pool for the InnoDB internal data dictionary and structures."
msgstr "Verouderde poel vir die interne InnoDB-datawoordeboek en -strukture."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Bytes; obsolete on modern servers."
msgstr "Grepe; uitgedien op moderne bedieners."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds an InnoDB transaction waits for a row lock before giving up."
msgstr "Sekondes wat 'n InnoDB-transaksie vir 'n ryslot wag voordat dit opgee."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds; default 50."
msgstr "Sekondes; verstek 50."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Method used to flush data and log files to disk."
msgstr "Metode wat gebruik word om data- en loglêers na skyf deur te spoel."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "O_DIRECT, fsync, O_DSYNC, and similar."
msgstr "O_DIRECT, fsync, O_DSYNC, en soortgelyk."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Controls how the redo log is written and flushed at transaction commit."
msgstr "Beheer hoe die redo-log geskryf en deurgespoel word by transaksiebevestiging."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "0, 1, or 2."
msgstr "0, 1, of 2."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Legacy single setting for InnoDB file I/O threads, replaced by the read/write I/O thread settings."
msgstr "Verouderde enkelinstelling vir InnoDB-lêer-I/O-drade, vervang deur die lees-/skryf-I/O-draadinstellings."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer; superseded by innodb_read_io_threads and innodb_write_io_threads."
msgstr "Heelgetal; vervang deur innodb_read_io_threads en innodb_write_io_threads."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Write and flush the InnoDB redo log every N seconds."
msgstr "Skryf en spoel die InnoDB-redo-log elke N sekondes deur."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Seconds (1-2700); default 1."
msgstr "Sekondes (1-2700); verstek 1."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of I/O threads used for read operations in InnoDB."
msgstr "Aantal I/O-drade wat vir leesbewerkings in InnoDB gebruik word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "1-64; default 4."
msgstr "1-64; verstek 4."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of I/O threads used for write operations in InnoDB."
msgstr "Aantal I/O-drade wat vir skryfbewerkings in InnoDB gebruik word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Number of regions the InnoDB buffer pool is divided into."
msgstr "Aantal streke waarin die InnoDB-bufferpoel verdeel is."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "1-64; MariaDB removed this in 10.6."
msgstr "1-64; MariaDB het dit in 10.6 verwyder."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Estimated I/O operations per second available to InnoDB background tasks."
msgstr "Geskatte I/O-bewerkings per sekonde beskikbaar vir InnoDB-agtergrondtake."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Integer; use higher values for SSD/NVMe storage."
msgstr "Heelgetal; gebruik hoër waardes vir SSD/NVMe-berging."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum IOPS InnoDB may use when flushing falls behind."
msgstr "Maksimum IOPS wat InnoDB mag gebruik wanneer deurspoeling agterraak."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Flush neighbouring dirty pages in the same extent when flushing a page."
msgstr "Spoel naburige vuil bladsye in dieselfde omvang deur wanneer 'n bladsy deurgespoel word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "0, 1, or 2; use 0 on SSD storage."
msgstr "0, 1, of 2; gebruik 0 op SSD-berging."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Use hardware atomic writes (MariaDB) so the doublewrite buffer can be safely disabled."
msgstr "Gebruik hardeware-atomiese skrywings (MariaDB) sodat die dubbelskryfbuffer veilig gedeaktiveer kan word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF; MariaDB only."
msgstr "ON of OFF; slegs MariaDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Enforce strict snapshot isolation for InnoDB transactions."
msgstr "Dwing streng momentopname-isolasie vir InnoDB-transaksies af."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "ON or OFF; back-ported to MariaDB 10.6.18+, 10.11.8+ and 11.4.2+. Set OFF for the Cacti poller."
msgstr "ON of OFF; teruggeport na MariaDB 10.6.18+, 10.11.8+ en 11.4.2+. Stel op OFF vir die Cacti-peiler."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Removed"
msgstr "Verwyder"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "Uitgefaseer"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Not applicable to this engine"
msgstr "Nie van toepassing op hierdie enjin nie"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Supported"
msgstr "Ondersteun"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Variable Capability Matrix"
msgstr "%s-veranderlike-vermoëmatriks"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Support by engine and version for each Cacti-recommended variable"
msgstr "Ondersteuning volgens enjin en weergawe vir elke Cacti-aanbevole veranderlike"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Veranderlike"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Available settings:"
msgstr "Beskikbare instellings:"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "N/A - Not applicable to this engine"
msgstr "N.v.t. - Nie van toepassing op hierdie enjin nie"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MariaDB 10.5+ and MySQL 8.0+ are the recommended, supported releases (for example, the default database streams on Rocky Linux 9). Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "MariaDB 10.5+ en MySQL 8.0+ is die aanbevole, ondersteunde weergawes (byvoorbeeld die verstek databasisstrome op Rocky Linux 9). Maak egter seker dat u die heel nuutste weergawe gebruik, wat 'n langdurige laevlak-netwerkprobleem oplos wat vir Spine baie betroubaarheidsprobleme veroorsaak het."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "Dit word STERK aanbeveel dat jy InnoDB aktiveer in enige %s-weergawe hoër as 5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Wanneer jy Cacti met ander tale as Engels gebruik, is dit belangrik om die utf8mb4_unicode_ci-kollasietipe te gebruik aangesien sommige karakters meer as een greep beslaan."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Wanneer jy Cacti met ander tale as Engels gebruik, is dit belangrik om die utf8mb4-karakterstel te gebruik aangesien sommige karakters meer as een greep beslaan."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Dit word aanbeveel dat jy InnoDB aktiveer in enige %s-weergawe hoër as 5.1."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Afhangende van die aantal aanmeldings en gebruik van die spine-dataversamelaar, sal %s baie verbindings benodig. Die berekening vir spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), dan moet jy speling laat vir gebruikersverbindings, wat sal wissel na gelang van die aantal gelyktydige aanmeldingsrekeninge."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Om die tabelkas groter te hou beteken minder lêer-oopmaak-/-toemaakbewerkings wanneer innodb_file_per_table gebruik word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Met afgeleë peilvermoëns sal groot hoeveelhede data vanaf die hoofbediener na die afgeleë peilers gesinkroniseer word. Hou dus hierdie waarde op of bo 16M."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Cacti Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "As u die Cacti Performance Booster gebruik en 'n geheuebergingenjin kies, moet u versigtig wees om u Performance Booster-buffer leeg te maak voordat die stelsel se geheuetabelspasie opraak. Dit word op twee maniere gedoen: eerstens deur die grootte van u uitvoerkolom na net die regte grootte te verklein. Hierdie kolom is in die tabelle poller_output en poller_output_boost. Die tweede ding wat u kan doen, is om meer geheue aan geheuetabelle toe te ken. Ons het arbitrêr 'n aanbevole waarde van 10%% van die stelselgeheue gekies, maar as u SSD-skyfaandrywers gebruik of 'n kleiner stelsel het, kan u hierdie aanbeveling ignoreer of 'n ander bergingenjin kies. U kan die verwagte verbruik van die Performance Booster-tabelle sien onder Konsole -> Stelselhulpmiddels -> Bekyk Boost-status."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Wanneer subnavrae uitgevoer word, hou 'n groter tydelike tabelgrootte daardie tydelike tabelle in die geheue."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Wanneer samesmeltings (joins) uitgevoer word en hulle kleiner as hierdie grootte is, sal hulle in die geheue gehou word en nooit na 'n tydelike lêer geskryf word nie.  Aangesien dit 'n geheuetoewysing per verbinding is, moet daar versigtig opgetree word om dit nie te hoog te verhoog nie.  Die som van die join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + kern-MySQL/MariaDB-geheue moet onder 80% wees.  As die aanbeveling negatief is, moet u hierdie waarde en/of die sort_buffer_size verlaag totdat die aanbeveling binne die toelaatbare geheue pas."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Wanneer InnoDB-berging gebruik word, is dit belangrik om u tabelspasies apart te hou. Dit maak die bestuur van die tabelle eenvoudiger vir langtermyngebruikers van %s. As u tans met hierdie funksie afgeskakel werk, kan u na berging per lêer migreer deur die funksie te aktiveer en daarna 'n ALTER-stelling op alle InnoDB-tabelle uit te voer."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Cacti tables."
msgstr "Wanneer innodb_file_per_table gebruik word, is dit belangrik om innodb_file_format op Barracuda te stel. Hierdie instelling sal langer indekse toelaat wat belangrik is vir sekere Cacti-tabelle."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "As u tabelle baie groot indekse het, moet u werk met die Barracuda innodb_file_format en die innodb_large_prefix gelyk aan 1. Versuim om dit te doen kan lei tot inproppe wat nie tabelle behoorlik kan skep nie."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size."
msgstr "InnoDB sal soveel tabelle en indekse as moontlik in die stelselgeheue hou.  Daarom moet u die innodb_buffer_pool groot genoeg maak om soveel van die tabelle en indekse as moontlik in die geheue te hou.  Om die grootte van die /var/lib/mysql/cacti-gids na te gaan, sal help om hierdie waarde te bepaal.  Ons beveel 25%% van u stelsel se totale geheue aan, maar u vereistes sal wissel na gelang van u stelsel se grootte."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This settings should remain ON unless your Cacti instances is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Hierdie instelling moet AAN (ON) bly, tensy u Cacti-instansies op óf ZFS óf FusionI/O loop, wat albei interne joernalering het om skielike stelselomvalle te hanteer.  As u egter baie betroubare krag het, u stelsels selde afgaan en u rugsteune het, kan die afskakeling van hierdie instelling na AF (OFF) u byna 'n 50%-verhoging in databasiswerkverrigting besorg."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Dit is waar metadata gestoor word. As u baie tabelle het, sal dit nuttig wees om dit te verhoog."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Onbeheerde navrae behoort nie die databasis vir ander vanlyn te dwing nie. Beëindig hierdie navrae voordat hulle u stelsel laat omval."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Maksimum I/O-prestasie vind plaas wanneer u die O_DIRECT-metode gebruik om bladsye uit te spoel."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Om hierdie waarde op 2 te stel, beteken dat u alle transaksies elke sekonde eerder as tydens bevestiging (commit) sal uitspoel. Dit stel %s in staat om minder gereeld te skryf."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Met moderne SSD-tipe berging is dit voordelig om veelvuldige I/O-drade te hê vir toepassings met hoë I/O-eienskappe."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, the you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Vanaf %1$s %2$s kan u beheer hoe gereeld %3$s transaksies na skyf uitspoel. Die verstekwaarde is 1 sekonde, maar in hoë-I/O-stelsels kan die stel van 'n waarde groter as 1 toelaat dat skyf-I/O meer sekwensieel is"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Met moderne SSD-tipe berging is dit voordelig om veelvuldige lees-I/O-drade te hê vir toepassings met hoë I/O-eienskappe. Afhangende van u MariaDB/MySQL-weergawes kan hierdie waarde so hoog as 64 wees. Probeer egter om die getal kleiner te hou as u totale SMT-drade op die databasisbediener."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Met moderne SSD-tipe berging is dit voordelig om veelvuldige skryf-I/O-drade te hê vir toepassings met hoë I/O-eienskappe. Afhangende van u MariaDB/MySQL-weergawes kan hierdie waarde so hoog as 64 wees. Probeer egter om die getal kleiner te hou as u totale SMT-drade op die databasisbediener."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s sal die innodb_buffer_pool in geheuestreke verdeel om prestasie te verbeter vir weergawes van MariaDB laer as 10.5. Die maksimum waarde is 64, maar moet nie die aantal CPU-kerne/-drade oorskry nie. Wanneer u innodb_buffer_pool kleiner as 1GB is, moet u die poelgrootte gedeel deur 128MB gebruik. Hou aan om hierdie vergelyking te gebruik tot by die maksimum van die aantal CPU-kerne of 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL upto and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "%s sal die innodb_buffer_pool in geheuestreke verdeel om prestasie te verbeter vir weergawes van MySQL tot en met MySQL 8.0. Die maksimum waarde is 64, maar moet nie die aantal CPU-kerne/-drade oorskry nie. Wanneer u innodb_buffer_pool kleiner as 1GB is, moet u die poelgrootte gedeel deur 128MB gebruik. Hou aan om hierdie vergelyking te gebruik tot by die maksimum van die aantal CPU-kerne of 64."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "As u SSD-skywe het, gebruik hierdie voorstel. As u fisiese hardeskywe het, gebruik 200 * die aantal aktiewe skywe in die skikking. Indien NVMe of PCIe Flash gebruik word, kan baie groter getalle so hoog as 100000 gebruik word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "As u SSD-skywe het, gebruik hierdie voorstel. As u fisiese hardeskywe het, gebruik 2000 * die aantal aktiewe skywe in die skikking. Indien NVMe of PCIe Flash gebruik word, kan baie groter getalle so hoog as 200000 gebruik word."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, set this to 0. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "As u SSD-skywe het, stel dit op 0. Andersins, moenie hierdie instelling stel nie."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Met moderne SSD-tipe berging is dit voordelig om veelvuldige lees-I/O-drade te hê vir toepassings met hoë I/O-eienskappe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Met moderne SSD-tipe berging is dit voordelig om veelvuldige skryf-I/O-drade te hê vir toepassings met hoë I/O-eienskappe."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Wanneer MariaDB 10.2.4 en hoër gebruik word, behoort hierdie instelling af te wees indien atomiese skryfbewerkings geaktiveer is. Aktiveer dus asseblief atomiese skryfbewerkings in plaas van die dubbelskryfbuffer, aangesien dit prestasie sal verhoog."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Wanneer MariaDB 10.2.4 en hoër gebruik word, kan u atomiese skryfbewerkings bo die dubbelskryfbuffer gebruik om prestasie te verhoog."

